<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40580" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι[πόλ]-αιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on</i>
			<i>the surface, superficial</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				69
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.184
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.6.4
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτὸν καὶ ἐ. δέρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					890a13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nav.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέον</span>
			<i>shallow</i> (of the skull), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμοί</span>, i.e. not
			deep-set, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				5.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. metaph.,
				<i>superficial, shallow</i>, <i>commonplace</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					15.190
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἡδοναὶ καὶ διατριβαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					61.56
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιθανότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Ther.Praef.</u>
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος πυρετός</span>
			<i>slight</i> fever, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				107
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὕπνος</span>
			<i>light</i> sleep, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>DMeretr.</u>
					8.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμης</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> . . φύσις</span> (compared to a well) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐ. ἀλλὰ πάνυ βαθεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.621
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>. <i>on the
				surface, manifest</i>: hence, <i>obvious</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λέγομεν τὰ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντὶ δῆλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1410b22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1412b25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπολαιότερον τοῦ ζητουμένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>EN</u>
					1095b24
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -οτάτη . . ζήτησις</span> the
				<i>most obvious</i> method of inquiry, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1276a19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπόλαιον τὸ ψεῦδος</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1282b30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>
			<i>on the surface</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτρώσκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					3.7.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>slightly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				2.28
			</span></i>; <i>superficially</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				987a22
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οτέρως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				993b13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπόλαιον, τό</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίπλοον</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπόλαια χρήματα</span>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπιπλα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				5.41
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5016.15
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
